# RepairHub Frontend Environment Variables Example
# In Vercel, add this under Project Settings -> Environment Variables

# Backend API URL (URL of your Render backend deployment without trailing slash)
# Example: https://repairhub-backend.onrender.com
# For local development with Vite proxy, leave empty or set to empty string
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-api-name.onrender.com
